# Create a separate one-line file for each name below under
# /etc/regional-proxy/credentials. Never put real values in this example.
hk-direct-uuid: REPLACE_WITH_UUID
us-exit-uuid: REPLACE_WITH_UUID
reality-private-key: REPLACE_WITH_SING_BOX_REALITY_PRIVATE_KEY
reality-short-id: REPLACE_WITH_HEX_SHORT_ID
tailnet-socks-user: REPLACE_WITH_RANDOM_USERNAME
tailnet-socks-password: REPLACE_WITH_RANDOM_PASSWORD
sachi-socks-user: copy the runtime value configured for Sachi's regionalProxySocksUser
sachi-socks-password: copy the runtime value configured for Sachi's regionalProxySocksPassword
